                                                "sense_id": "457d0e92-9d3c-3cf6-99c1-dd251165e02b",
                                                "text": "And before the season's over millions of \"glassies\" and \"aggies\" or \"ironies\" will change hands, and thousands more will manage to get themselves lost."
